 "summary": "`Orthonormal.prodOrthogonalEquiv`, `sub_sum_inner_smul_mem_orthogonal` and `mem_orthogonal_span_range_iff` have no Mathlib or Tau Ceti counterpart (the closest, `Submodule.prodEquivOfIsCompl` and `mem_orthogonalBilin_span`, give only a non-continuous linear equivalence or are already used as the underlying lemma). The bundle side reuses `contMDiff_hom_bundle_iff`, `ContMDiff.clm_bundle_equiv_symm`, `bundleDiffeomorphOfHom` and `contMDiff_trivialProdOrthogonalSpanFamily_sum`, and deletes the old duplicated inverse proofs.",
